   "source": [
    "### 4. Compute 𝐸[𝑋], 𝐸[𝑌], 𝐸[𝑋𝑌], Var(𝑋), Cov(𝑋, 𝑌) and the correlation coefficient, all by hand, and verify each by quadrature."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4d38e120",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "*Computing 𝐸[𝑋] and 𝐸[𝑌]* \n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\begin{align*}\n",
    "E[X] &= \\int_0^1 x \\left(x + \\frac{1}{2}\\right) dx \\\\\n",
    "     &= \\int_0^1 \\left(x^2 + \\frac{1}{2}x\\right) dx \\\\\n",
    "     &= \\left[ \\frac{x^3}{3} + \\frac{x^2}{4} \\right]_0^1 \\\\\n",
    "     &= \\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{4} = \\boxed{\\frac{7}{12} = 0.583}\n",
    "\\end{align*} \\\\\n",
    "\\text{Due to symmetry: }\\ \\boxed{E[Y] = \\frac{7}{12} = 0.583}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "___\n",
    "\n",
    "*Computing 𝐸[𝑋𝑌]*\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\begin{align*}\n",
    "E[XY] &= \\int_0^1 \\int_0^1 xy(x + y) \\, dx \\, dy \\\\\n",
    "      &= \\int_0^1 \\left[ \\frac{x^3}{3}y + \\frac{x^2}{2}y^2 \\right]_{x=0}^{x=1} dy \\\\\n",
    "      &= \\int_0^1 \\left( \\frac{1}{3}y + \\frac{1}{2}y^2 \\right) dy \\\\\n",
    "      &= \\left[ \\frac{y^2}{6} + \\frac{y^3}{6} \\right]_0^1 \\\\\n",
    "      &= \\boxed{\\frac{1}{6} + \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{1}{3} = 0.333}\n",
    "\\end{align*}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "___\n",
    "\n",
    "*Computing Var(𝑋)*\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\begin{align*}\n",
    "E[X^2] &= \\int_0^1 x^2 \\left(x + \\frac{1}{2}\\right) dx \\\\\n",
    "       &= \\left[ \\frac{x^4}{4} + \\frac{x^3}{6} \\right]_0^1 \\\\ \n",
    "       &= \\frac{1}{4} + \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{5}{12}\n",
    "\\end{align*}\n",
    "\\\\\n",
    "\\\\\n",
    "\\begin{align*}\n",
    "Var(X) &= E[X^2] - (E[X])^2 \\\\\n",
    "&= \\frac{5}{12} - \\left(\\frac{7}{12}\\right)^2 \\\\\n",
    "&= \\frac{60 - 49}{144} \\\\\n",
    "&= \\boxed{\\frac{11}{144}}\n",
    "\\end{align*}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "___\n",
    "\n",
    "*Computing Cov(𝑋, 𝑌)*\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\begin{align*}\n",
    "Cov(X, Y) &= E[XY] - E[X]E[Y] \\\\\n",
    "          &= \\frac{1}{3} - \\left(\\frac{7}{12}\\right)\\left(\\frac{7}{12}\\right) \\\\\n",
    "          &= \\boxed{\\frac{48 - 49}{144} = -\\frac{1}{144}}\n",
    "\\end{align*}\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
