   "source": [
    "## The Conditional Gaussian\n",
    "\n",
    "### Part 1:\n",
    "\n",
    "With mean zero and Σ = [[4, 2], [2, 4]]: det Σ = 12 and Σ⁻¹ = (1/12)[[4, -2], [-2, 4]].\n",
    "\n",
    "The exponent of the joint density is\n",
    "$$-\\tfrac12 \\mathbf v^T\\Sigma^{-1}\\mathbf v = -\\tfrac16\\,(x^2 - xy + y^2).$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Complete the square in y:\n",
    "$$x^2 - xy + y^2 = \\left(y - \\tfrac{x}{2}\\right)^2 + \\tfrac34 x^2 .$$\n",
    "\n",
    "So the joint density factors into a piece with only x and a piece with y:\n",
    "$$f_{XY}(x,y) = \\underbrace{\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi\\cdot 4}}e^{-x^2/8}}_{f_X(x),\\ X\\sim N(0,4)} \\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi\\cdot 3}}\\exp\\!\\left(-\\frac{(y-x/2)^2}{2\\cdot 3}\\right).$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Dividing by $f_X(x)$ gives\n",
    "$$Y \\mid X=x \\sim N(0.5\\,x,\\ 3).$$\n",
    "It is Gaussian, the mean is linear in x, and the variance does not depend on x.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "### Part 2: \n",
    "For a partitioned Gaussian vector with blocks a and b:\n",
    "$$\\mu_{a|b} = \\mu_a + \\Sigma_{ab}\\Sigma_{bb}^{-1}(x_b-\\mu_b), \\qquad\n",
    "\\Sigma_{a|b} = \\Sigma_{aa} - \\Sigma_{ab}\\Sigma_{bb}^{-1}\\Sigma_{ba}.$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Here a = Y, b = X, so $\\Sigma_{aa}=4$, $\\Sigma_{ab}=2$, $\\Sigma_{bb}=4$:\n",
    "$$\\mu_{Y|X} = \\tfrac{2}{4}x = 0.5x, \\qquad \\sigma^2_{Y|X} = 4 - \\tfrac{2\\cdot 2}{4} = 3.$$\n",
    "This matches Part 1."
   ]
